mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">英伟达携手SK海力士等五家韩国巨头共同构建AI工厂并布局物理AI</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">SpaceX即将上市并公开首款AI数据中心卫星AI1关键参数与设计细节</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI秘密提交上市申请，奥特曼旗下眼球扫描公司Tools for Humanity宣布裁员</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌NotebookLM升级Gemini 3.5并接入智能体，首批面向付费用户开放代码与图表生成功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8c5574c883415011ed11df2ffc9ec05d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式为AI研究工具NotebookLM推送重大升级，底层模型切换至Gemini 3.5并深度接入智能体Antigravity。此次更新引入安全云端计算环境，支持在笔记本内直接编写并运行代码、深度分析数据及实时生成图表。用户可直接输出PNG、SVG图表，以及PDF、Markdown、Excel和PowerPoint等十余种格式文件，实现从数据分析到内容生成的全流程闭环。谷歌采取分级付费策略，新功能首批仅向AI Ultra订阅用户及部分企业级Workspace客户开放。内部评估显示，新版系统在大文档分析与高级网页研究等维度的平均胜率超过65%。此次升级标志着NotebookLM从文档整理工具演进为具备全栈生产力的AI研究助理，反映出AI应用正从问答式轻交互向重流程式端到端生产深度演进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果因欧盟数字市场法案合规分歧推迟新版Siri AI在欧上线</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9328331fc4efec5c1d3e01c7bac78499.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在2026年WWDC大会上，苹果发布了新一代Siri AI，但受欧盟《数字市场法案》（DMA）合规要求影响，该功能在欧盟地区的iPhone和iPad平台上线受阻。苹果声明指出，欧盟监管机构对DMA的严苛解读要求其开放第三方虚拟助手对用户私有数据的访问权限，并允许第三方AI直接控制系统内应用，这与苹果端侧处理及私有云计算的隐私保护底线存在严重分歧。目前，英语版Siri AI将于今年晚些时候推出，但欧洲市场初期仅macOS、watchOS和visionOS平台获得部分更新支持。苹果明确表示，在无法确保数据绝对安全的前提下，不会盲目开放核心接口，欧洲用户体验完整版Siri AI仍需等待后续的合规博弈与调整。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达携手SK海力士等五家韩国巨头共同构建AI工厂并布局物理AI</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正式与SK海力士、SK电讯、斗山集团、LG集团及NAVER达成战略合作，旨在共同构建以电力驱动、数据Token为产出的“AI工厂”，深化物理AI（Physical AI）领域布局。此次合作旨在为机器人、自动驾驶及自主感知设备提供理解物理环境的“大脑”，并配套发布了全模态物理AI模型Cosmos 3。各方分工明确：SK海力士专注下一代存储技术；SK电讯依托英伟达DSX平台建设吉瓦（GW）级AI云基础设施，首个工厂预计2027年运营；斗山集团提供智能机器人与电力方案；LG集团构建自主制造生态；NAVER负责基础设施搭建。此举标志着英伟达通过深度绑定产业链上下游，加速推动物理AI从数字世界向智能制造商业化落地，进一步夯实其在全球AI生态中的核心地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceX即将上市并公开首款AI数据中心卫星AI1关键参数与设计细节</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94d31628bc6da5757c27d842516821a2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceX预计于本周正式上市，首席执行官埃隆·马斯克于周一公开了轨道AI数据中心卫星项目“AI1”的最新细节。该卫星旨在构建百万颗轨道卫星网络，专门执行复杂AI计算任务。硬件规格方面，AI1配备翼展达70米的巨型太阳能电池板，平均计算负载能力为120千瓦，峰值可达150千瓦。马斯克表示，由于AI1无需星链系统复杂的通信天线，仅由太阳能板、散热器和激光链路构成，其设计与制造难度比星链更简单。为支持该项目，SpaceX计划扩建德州巴斯特罗普工厂，打造面积超1100万平方英尺的“Gigasat”超级工厂，专门生产卫星所需的大型太阳能电池板。此举标志着SpaceX正式进军太空AI算力基础设施领域，将对全球商业航天及边缘计算产业产生深远影响。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI秘密提交上市申请，奥特曼旗下眼球扫描公司Tools for Humanity宣布裁员</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/62eaa11015e5765ca0d7b6cf73e106e2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">人工智能巨头OpenAI近日已秘密提交上市申请。与此同时，由OpenAI CEO萨姆·奥特曼联合创立的眼球扫描创业公司Tools for Humanity在周一宣布裁员。该公司估值曾达25亿美元，核心产品为虹膜扫描设备“Orb”，旨在通过扫描眼球生成数字身份以区分人类与AI。尽管吸引了数百万注册用户并获得安德森·霍洛维茨基金、贝恩资本等顶级机构数亿美元投资，但Tools for Humanity长期面临商业化变现困难，且其虹膜扫描技术在隐私与数据合规方面持续受到各国监管机构质疑。目前，该公司总员工数超过500人，具体裁员规模尚未披露。公司计划在周二的全员大会上进一步说明战略调整及裁员安排。此次事件凸显了明星硬件创业公司在缺乏持续收入模式下的转型压力，以及在数字身份验证领域面临的市场与合规挑战。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
